      {
        "id": "60b65b7f-225d-4725-9247-0e9311e69db6",
        "index": 0,
        "body": "The nephron loops of juxtamedullary nephrons are involved in the countercurrent multiplier system.",
        "questionId": "2cd1db99-2f86-4c4d-a2e4-35aee5eac73a",
        "stats": {
